sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant BFF
    participant ASR as ASR Mock / Real ASR

    Browser->>BFF: Connect /intelligentVoice/asr/stream?sampleRate&language
    BFF-->>Browser: WebSocket connected
    Browser->>BFF: PCM chunk 1
    BFF->>ASR: Establish or reuse managed connection
    BFF->>ASR: PCM chunk 1
    ASR-->>BFF: {text:partial-1,isFinal:false}
    BFF-->>Browser: Replace current dynamic text
    Browser->>BFF: PCM chunk 2
    BFF->>ASR: PCM chunk 2
    ASR-->>BFF: {text:partial-2,isFinal:false}
    BFF-->>Browser: Replace current dynamic text
    Browser->>BFF: PCM chunk 3
    BFF->>ASR: PCM chunk 3
    ASR-->>BFF: {text:sentence-1,isFinal:true}
    BFF-->>Browser: Replace dynamic text with confirmed text
    Note over Browser,ASR: Recognition Session remains active for the next sentence
    Browser->>BFF: {"action":"stop"}
    BFF->>ASR: {"action":"stop"}
    ASR-->>BFF: Final unfinished sentence or empty final acknowledgement
    BFF-->>Browser: Session ended; WebSocket remains open
